    "These permissions are requested after your first Watch sync, not when you open the app. Syncing sessions and showing city names work without them. City names come from GPS recorded on the Watch, not from the iPhone’s live location.": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "These permissions are requested after your first Watch sync, not when you open the app. Syncing sessions and showing city names work without them. City names come from GPS recorded on the Watch, not from the iPhone’s live location."
          }
        },
        "nl": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Deze machtigingen worden gevraagd na je eerste Watch-sync, niet wanneer je de app opent. Sessies synchroniseren en stadsnamen tonen werkt ook zonder. Stadsnamen komen uit GPS die op de Watch is opgenomen, niet uit de live locatie van de iPhone."
          }
        }
      }
    },
